<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Feb CPI data to be issued at 1100 GMT.</title>
<headline>Portugal Feb CPI data to be issued at 1100 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) said it would issue its consumer price index (CPI) for February at 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
